# RetroArch + libretro cores are NOT in live-build package lists (one failed package
# aborts the whole apt pass). On the slim live ISO they are also skipped in hook 997.
# Calamares gamebian-web-install installs /usr/share/gamebian/*-retroarch.list on the
# target disk (set GAMEBIAN_LIVE_INCLUDE_EMULATORS=1 during lb build to bake them in).
